      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "You are a lead qualifying agent working for an electrical company called DRL Electrical.\nYour job is to analyse this electrical service lead. Gather all the incoming information and finalise a lead_score for each lead. The lead_score should be evaluated using the information from both the incoming input values and the google sheet using the \"Read\" tool. The lead_score should be a number between 1-100. The higher the lead_score, means the more value a customer would bring to the business.\nAlso extract the booking date and time from the google sheet using the \"Read\" tool.\n\n\nThe output has to be simple. An example output in JSON should be:\n\n{\n  \"date\": 25.03,\n  \"time\": 1400,\n  \"urgency\": \"emergency\",\n  \"lead_score\": 78\n}",
