    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# How this Automation Works\n1)Lead Info gets qualified and job details sent to team\n2) Team accepts or declines job\n3) If accepts: team will have to manually plug in the job themselves, and confirmation emails of the job will be sent to the client.\n4) If declines: team will have to contact client about adjustments required for the job (i.e, date/time changes, clarity, etc). Customer also gets notified that team will contact them about some required changes.\n\nNotes:\n- This automation gives you the option of accepting or declining jobs.\n\n- If the query was for a job booking then the AI Agent will continue (Query has to be about a service we offer).\n\n- If the query is unrelated then the AI Agent kindly advises that this isn't a service that we provide.",
        "height": 352,
        "width": 576,
        "color": 5
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        288,
